{
    "title": "BMX Cycle Extreme Bicycle Game",
    "description": "PlayFlix presents a cycle race game named as BMX Cycle Extreme Bicycle Game in which you have to ride a cycle against your opponents to reach at the end point to win the race. Perform jaw-dropping tricks, earn points, unlock new trails, and enhance your skills. Get ready for an action-packed adventure on two wheels!\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"blue\">Features for our BMX Cycle Simulator Game!</font></b>\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Race with your opponents\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Impressive 3D visuals\r\n\ud83e\udd4a Player vs. player competitive structure\r\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Mountain and woodland tracks\r\n\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Numerous bicycle customization options\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Simple and responsive commands\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc1 \ud83c\udfc1 \ud83c\udfc1 <b><font color=\"blue\">Are you a cycle racing games fan ?</font></b>\ud83d\udeb2\r\n\r\nCome and have fun by riding a bmx bike in our bicycle rider 3d game which will take you in breathtaking scenery from snowy mountain peaks to sun-soaked deserts. Your bike is your ticket to adventure, and you can enhance it after every ride with unique upgrades.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeb2\ud83d\udeb4\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb5 \ud83d\udef4 <b><font color=\"blue\">A Variety of 2-wheel Vehicles!</font></b>\r\n\r\nUpgrade your bike with unique mods, from speed to stunts, and experience thrilling rides with Bicycle Adventure. A variety of bicycles available in our cycle game for your entertainment. Enthusiasts know it by the name of cycle wali game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "PlayFlix presents a cycle race game named as BMX Cycle Extreme Bicycle Game in which you have to ride a cycle against your opponents to reach at the end point to win the race. Perform jaw-dropping tricks, earn points, unlock new trails, and enhance your skills. Get ready for an action-packed adventure on two wheels!<br><br><b><font color=\"blue\">Features for our BMX Cycle Simulator Game!</font></b><br><br>\ud83e\udd1d Race with your opponents<br>\ud83c\udf1f Impressive 3D visuals<br>\ud83e\udd4a Player vs. player competitive structure<br>\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Mountain and woodland tracks<br>\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Numerous bicycle customization options<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Simple and responsive commands<br><br>\ud83c\udfc1 \ud83c\udfc1 \ud83c\udfc1 <b><font color=\"blue\">Are you a cycle racing games fan ?</font></b>\ud83d\udeb2<br><br>Come and have fun by riding a bmx bike in our bicycle rider 3d game which will take you in breathtaking scenery from snowy mountain peaks to sun-soaked deserts. Your bike is your ticket to adventure, and you can enhance it after every ride with unique upgrades.<br><br>\ud83d\udeb2\ud83d\udeb4\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb5 \ud83d\udef4 <b><font color=\"blue\">A Variety of 2-wheel Vehicles!</font></b><br><br>Upgrade your bike with unique mods, from speed to stunts, and experience thrilling rides with Bicycle Adventure. A variety of bicycles available in our cycle game for your entertainment. Enthusiasts know it by the name of cycle wali game.",
